    "div" : "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: ValueSet ng-hiv-int-lab-other-test-vs</b></p><a name=\"ng-hiv-int-lab-other-test-vs\"> </a><a name=\"hcng-hiv-int-lab-other-test-vs\"> </a><ul><li>Include these codes as defined in <a href=\"CodeSystem-ng-hiv-int-lab-form-cs.html\"><code>https://fhir-ig.digitalhealth.gov.ng/CodeSystem/ng-hiv-int-lab-form-cs</code></a><span title=\"Version is not explicitly stated, which means it is fixed to the version provided in this specification\"> version &#x1F4E6;0.0.0</span><table class=\"none\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td><td><b>Definition</b></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-ng-hiv-int-lab-form-cs.html#ng-hiv-int-lab-form-cs-other-test-cd4-count\">other-test-cd4-count</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">CD4+ cell count</td><td>Absolute CD4+ cell count.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-ng-hiv-int-lab-form-cs.html#ng-hiv-int-lab-form-cs-other-test-cd4-percentage\">other-test-cd4-percentage</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">CD4 percentage</td><td>CD4 percentage.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-ng-hiv-int-lab-form-cs.html#ng-hiv-int-lab-form-cs-other-test-cd4-lfa\">other-test-cd4-lfa</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">CD4 LFA</td><td>CD4 lateral-flow assay.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-ng-hiv-int-lab-form-cs.html#ng-hiv-int-lab-form-cs-other-test-tb-lf-lam\">other-test-tb-lf-lam</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">TB LF-LAM</td><td>Tuberculosis lateral-flow urine lipoarabinomannan test.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-ng-hiv-int-lab-form-cs.html#ng-hiv-int-lab-form-cs-other-test-serum-crag\">other-test-serum-crag</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">Serum CrAg</td><td>Serum cryptococcal antigen test.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-ng-hiv-int-lab-form-cs.html#ng-hiv-int-lab-form-cs-other-test-csf-crag\">other-test-csf-crag</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">CSF CrAg</td><td>Cerebrospinal-fluid cryptococcal antigen test.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-ng-hiv-int-lab-form-cs.html#ng-hiv-int-lab-form-cs-other-test-csf-mcs\">other-test-csf-mcs</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">CSF M/C/S</td><td>Cerebrospinal-fluid microscopy, culture and sensitivity.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-ng-hiv-int-lab-form-cs.html#ng-hiv-int-lab-form-cs-other-test-hbsag\">other-test-hbsag</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">HBsAg</td><td>Hepatitis B surface antigen test.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-ng-hiv-int-lab-form-cs.html#ng-hiv-int-lab-form-cs-other-test-hcv-antibody\">other-test-hcv-antibody</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">HCV antibody</td><td>Hepatitis C virus antibody test.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-ng-hiv-int-lab-form-cs.html#ng-hiv-int-lab-form-cs-other-test-hbv-viral-load\">other-test-hbv-viral-load</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">HBV viral load</td><td>Hepatitis B virus viral-load test.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-ng-hiv-int-lab-form-cs.html#ng-hiv-int-lab-form-cs-other-test-hcv-viral-load\">other-test-hcv-viral-load</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">HCV viral load</td><td>Hepatitis C virus viral-load test.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-ng-hiv-int-lab-form-cs.html#ng-hiv-int-lab-form-cs-other-test-syphilis\">other-test-syphilis</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">Syphilis</td><td>Syphilis serology.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-ng-hiv-int-lab-form-cs.html#ng-hiv-int-lab-form-cs-other-test-hpv\">other-test-hpv</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">HPV</td><td>Human papillomavirus test.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-ng-hiv-int-lab-form-cs.html#ng-hiv-int-lab-form-cs-other-test-cytology\">other-test-cytology</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">Cytology</td><td>Cytology or cervical-screening test, including VIA or Pap smear as printed on the source form.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-ng-hiv-int-lab-form-cs.html#ng-hiv-int-lab-form-cs-other-test-random-glucose\">other-test-random-glucose</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">Random glucose</td><td>Random blood-glucose test.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-ng-hiv-int-lab-form-cs.html#ng-hiv-int-lab-form-cs-other-test-naat\">other-test-naat</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">NAAT</td><td>Nucleic-acid amplification test; the target organism is not specified on the source form.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-ng-hiv-int-lab-form-cs.html#ng-hiv-int-lab-form-cs-other-test-urinalysis\">other-test-urinalysis</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">Urinalysis</td><td>Urinalysis.</td></tr></table></li></ul></div>"
